### AeroTrip API — try these from VS Code (REST Client) or Visual Studio / Rider.
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Endpoint index (lists every route and who can call it)
GET http://localhost:5080/

### Airports (guest)
GET {{api}}/catalog/airports

### Search flights (guest) — change the date to any future day
GET {{api}}/flights/search?from=DEL&to=BOM&date=2026-12-15&passengers=2&cabin=Economy

### Connecting flights only (no direct AMD–COK route)
GET {{api}}/flights/search?from=AMD&to=COK&date=2026-12-15&passengers=1

### Log in as a traveller — copy "token" into @token below
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "riya@aerotrip.com", "password": "User@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### My bookings
GET {{api}}/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Price quote with a coupon (replace itineraryId with an "id" from search)
POST {{api}}/bookings/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itineraryId": "SF101-20261215", "cabin": "Economy", "passengers": 1, "extras": { "meal": true }, "couponCode": "FLYNEW" }

### Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@aerotrip.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### Admin dashboard stats
GET {{api}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
